<title>NORWAY: Helicopter Services buys Super Pumas.</title>
<headline>Helicopter Services buys Super Pumas.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Helicopter Services Group ASA said on Tuesday it had agreed to buy up to four Super Puma offshore shuttle helicopters from Eurocopter SA of France.</p>
<p>The helicopters will be delivered from April 1998 to March 1999 at a maximum total cost of 350 million crowns ($50.2 million), it said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41 ($ = 6.978 Norwegian Crowns)</p>
</text>
